<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fernz raises stake in CFPI to 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Fernz raises stake in CFPI to 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand chemical group Fernz Corporation said on Tuesday it had raised its stake in French industrial company CFPI to 21.2 percent from 11.25 percent, and reserved the right to increase it.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
